<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-NICE WIN FRENCH CUP ON PENALTIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NICE WIN FRENCH CUP ON PENALTIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nice and Guingamp drew 1-1 after extra time (halftime 1-0, score after 90 minutes 1-1) in the French Cup final at Parc des Princes on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Nice - Youssef Salimi 21</p>
<p>Guingamp - Nicolas Laspalles 77</p>
<p>Attendance: 44,131</p>
<p>Nice won 4-3 on penalties</p>
</text>
